   "text": "Thanks, Hannah. You're verified.\n\n**Order #K-6101 (Saffron Lane)**\nOur delivery records match what you said. The order was promised for 6:00 pm and handed to you at 6:50 pm, which is 50 minutes late. For deliveries 45 minutes or more late, we give account credit of 20% of the order subtotal. Your subtotal was $60.00, so **I've added $12.00 in credit to your account**. You can use it on future orders. Late deliveries are covered with account credit only, not a refund to your card.\n\nWhat's the next problem? If you have the order number, please send it."
