   "text": "I'm sorry the churros were missing. Unfortunately I can't compensate for them. Missing items have to be reported within 48 hours of delivery. Order #K-6103 was handed to you on Wednesday at 7:10 pm, about 72 hours ago, and there's no earlier report of it on your account. Our policy doesn't let me make exceptions to that window. In future, if you report a missing item within 48 hours, we can refund it or give you credit for it.\n\nHere's a summary of what we sorted out today:\n\n| Order | Problem | Outcome |\n|---|---|---|\n| #K-6101 Saffron Lane | 50 minutes late | $12.00 account credit |\n| #K-6101 Saffron Lane | Missing Mango lassi | $5.40 account credit |\n| #K-6102 Burger Barn | Wrong burger (beef instead of veggie) | $11.00 refund to Visa ending 4242 (3\u20135 business days) |\n| #K-6103 Taqueria Luz | Missing churros | Not eligible (reported after 48 hours) |\n\nYour account credit balance is now **$17.40**, and you can use it on your next order. Is there anything else I can help with?"
